WEBVTT

01:37.920 --> 01:40.750
[Fate Chooses You]

01:41.280 --> 01:43.650
[Episode 33]

01:44.720 --> 01:46.890
[Xutuo City]

01:46.960 --> 01:52.520
[Caiyuan Inn]

01:59.789 --> 02:00.680
Could Zigai Mountain

02:00.680 --> 02:01.840
be the immortal sect

02:01.840 --> 02:02.870
in the Central Plains

02:02.870 --> 02:04.800
that Qinghong Sect colludes with?

02:05.590 --> 02:06.520
For what reason?

02:06.870 --> 02:07.870
For lack of money.

02:09.910 --> 02:11.490
It doesn't seem like it, though.

02:11.490 --> 02:12.680
I don't think they would dare to offend

02:12.680 --> 02:15.540
Lingji Mountain and Tianyuan Sect
at the same time.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.090
What if it's Tianyuan Sect?

02:17.240 --> 02:18.030
Impossible.

02:18.560 --> 02:20.190
Tianyuan Sect is the leader
of the righteous path

02:20.190 --> 02:21.740
and the head of immortal sects.

02:21.740 --> 02:22.800
Besides the reclusive

02:22.800 --> 02:23.530
Youhu Clan,

02:23.560 --> 02:25.030
it is the most powerful sect.

02:25.030 --> 02:25.560
Plus, what

02:25.560 --> 02:27.079
would they get out of colluding

02:27.079 --> 02:28.210
with Qinghong Sect?

02:36.590 --> 02:37.120
Alright.

02:39.470 --> 02:40.670
Take care, miss, sir.

02:41.150 --> 02:42.810
You get in the carriage first.

03:08.310 --> 03:09.770
Who asked you to follow us?

03:12.000 --> 03:13.530
I suppose you are well aware

03:13.630 --> 03:15.360
that you won't be able to escape

03:15.360 --> 03:17.560
once we have you in the palm of our hands.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.590
Their faces were covered.

03:19.590 --> 03:21.120
All they asked us to do was spy on you

03:21.120 --> 03:22.570
and inform them of any happenings.

03:22.570 --> 03:23.240
We waited for you

03:23.240 --> 03:25.100
for nearly 6 months in the desert.

03:50.680 --> 03:51.140
Senior,

03:51.400 --> 03:52.400
what should we do?

03:52.520 --> 03:53.710
Go after them separately.

03:53.710 --> 03:54.840
Don't let anyone get away.

03:54.840 --> 03:55.500
-Yes!
-Yes!

04:08.710 --> 04:11.150
So you've lured everyone away
from the city.

04:11.150 --> 04:11.840
This could only

04:11.840 --> 04:13.100
stall them for a while.

04:13.680 --> 04:15.080
We still have to hurry up.

04:15.190 --> 04:17.589
We won't be safe
until we reach the capital.

04:39.390 --> 04:40.250
Who are you lot?

04:40.390 --> 04:41.159
Where is Lu Qianqiao?

04:41.159 --> 04:42.680
We don't know who Lu Qianqiao is.

04:42.680 --> 04:43.310
A man

04:43.480 --> 04:44.340
paid us to drive

04:44.360 --> 04:46.090
the carriage to random places.

04:46.430 --> 04:47.230
That's right.

04:47.240 --> 04:47.770
Exactly.

04:48.470 --> 04:49.270
This is a trap.

05:00.800 --> 05:01.730
Hey, Miss Sheng,

05:02.560 --> 05:03.310
you've spent nearly an hour

05:03.310 --> 05:04.370
washing your face.

05:04.630 --> 05:07.030
How big is it?
Why is the wash taking so long?

05:07.120 --> 05:08.650
It's none of your business.

05:27.120 --> 05:27.830
What is...

05:28.480 --> 05:29.410
going on with me?

05:58.680 --> 05:59.880
They're right ahead.

06:00.270 --> 06:01.070
Go after them!

06:19.870 --> 06:21.000
You don't look well.

06:21.190 --> 06:22.920
Care for a rest in the carriage?

06:23.190 --> 06:24.390
We should keep moving

06:24.680 --> 06:26.810
and rest only when we deliver the book.

06:33.310 --> 06:34.770
Tianyuan Sect is after us.

06:36.240 --> 06:38.700
We can't get rid of them
if we stick together.

06:43.750 --> 06:44.720
Let's split up.

06:45.040 --> 06:45.950
You take the book.

06:45.950 --> 06:48.610
I'll distract them
while driving the carriage.

06:50.430 --> 06:51.490
What are you doing?

06:52.510 --> 06:53.480
How can I let you

06:53.510 --> 06:54.430
be the hero?

06:55.310 --> 06:56.040
Just watch me

06:56.159 --> 06:57.409
play those fools.

07:38.580 --> 07:40.570
[Sun Gang, Wushuang Society]

07:39.050 --> 07:39.580
General,

07:39.870 --> 07:40.730
here she comes.

07:46.920 --> 07:47.680
Miss Sheng,

07:48.270 --> 07:48.950
I am Qin Yan.

07:49.159 --> 07:52.290
By command of Wushuang Society,
I'm here to receive you.

07:54.120 --> 07:56.409
I've brought back
the Unparalleled Secret Magic.

07:56.409 --> 07:58.200
Our deepest gratitude to you, Miss Sheng.

07:58.200 --> 08:01.120
Your favor will benefit all humans
for generations to come.

08:01.120 --> 08:02.120
Thank you so much.

08:03.650 --> 08:04.240
My fellows and I

08:04.240 --> 08:05.700
rushed back in two groups.

08:05.750 --> 08:07.540
My senior sister, Xin Mei, teamed up

08:07.540 --> 08:08.160
with a man

08:08.160 --> 08:09.220
named Lu Qianqiao.

08:09.680 --> 08:10.760
Have you seen them?

08:11.000 --> 08:12.160
They arrived before you did

08:12.160 --> 08:13.630
and have gone to meet the master.

08:13.630 --> 08:14.690
Don't worry, miss.

08:15.480 --> 08:16.410
This is Sun Gang.

08:16.630 --> 08:17.600
He's familiar with the route.

08:17.600 --> 08:18.680
Follow him, and you will

08:18.680 --> 08:20.140
get to the capital safely.

08:20.720 --> 08:21.720
I can't leave yet.

08:22.160 --> 08:23.600
Those from immortal sects are coming.

08:23.600 --> 08:25.160
We need to set up traps in advance,

08:25.160 --> 08:26.680
or it'll be hard to hold them off.

08:26.680 --> 08:27.680
It's not a problem.

08:27.680 --> 08:28.920
All you need to do is escort the book

08:28.920 --> 08:29.780
to the capital.

08:29.830 --> 08:30.690
As for the rest,

08:30.870 --> 08:31.670
leave it to us.

08:43.390 --> 08:44.790
You are not cultivators?

08:45.240 --> 08:46.040
No, we're not.

08:46.440 --> 08:47.440
We're all humans.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.750
You won't be able to fight them off.

08:49.750 --> 08:51.080
But we don't fear death.

08:51.480 --> 08:52.440
As long as the Unparalleled Secret Magic

08:52.440 --> 08:54.080
safely returns to the capital,

08:54.080 --> 08:55.480
all the sacrifices today

08:55.600 --> 08:56.730
will be worthwhile.

08:57.240 --> 08:57.750
Miss,

08:58.360 --> 08:59.560
it's time you set out.

09:00.510 --> 09:01.790
With you people around,

09:01.790 --> 09:03.250
humanity will never fall.

09:03.720 --> 09:05.380
Thank you for your kind words.

09:52.720 --> 09:54.910
Hero, heroine, you must be tired
from the journey.

09:54.910 --> 09:56.710
I've prepared some guest rooms.

09:57.150 --> 09:58.720
Please take a rest

09:59.030 --> 10:00.090
and eat something.

10:00.390 --> 10:02.260
We already ate
when we entered the city.

10:02.260 --> 10:02.840
I suggest we bring them

10:02.840 --> 10:04.100
to meet the master now.

10:08.840 --> 10:10.360
Has the master gone to bed already?

10:10.360 --> 10:12.160
He went to bed a long time ago.

10:12.360 --> 10:14.150
Yet upon hearing
about the return of the book,

10:14.150 --> 10:15.120
he got up immediately.

10:15.120 --> 10:16.030
He still has

10:16.440 --> 10:17.770
the candles on till now.

10:18.550 --> 10:19.320
Pardon us for not

10:19.320 --> 10:20.850
walking you to his chamber.

10:21.150 --> 10:22.150
This way, please.

10:24.030 --> 10:24.510
Thanks.

10:44.440 --> 10:45.120
Lord Zhi?

10:52.910 --> 10:53.720
Miss Xin,

10:54.150 --> 10:56.350
I didn't expect to see you again so soon.

11:00.440 --> 11:01.570
Take a seat, please.

11:07.360 --> 11:07.790
Here.

11:18.440 --> 11:19.500
Are you surprised?

11:20.510 --> 11:21.340
Yes, a little.

11:21.790 --> 11:22.990
The Lord Zhi before me

11:23.200 --> 11:24.330
doesn't quite match

11:24.400 --> 11:25.000
my memory

11:25.030 --> 11:26.630
of the eloquent Lord Zhi I met

11:26.840 --> 11:28.150
in Chongling Valley.

11:29.200 --> 11:30.920
One must fulfill
the duties of his position.

11:30.920 --> 11:31.520
Today, I am

11:31.550 --> 11:33.200
the master of Wushuang Society.

11:33.200 --> 11:34.630
On behalf of Wushuang Society

11:34.630 --> 11:35.790
and all the people,

11:37.200 --> 11:39.150
I extend my sincere thanks to you both.

11:39.150 --> 11:39.600
Sir,

11:40.030 --> 11:40.960
no need for this.

11:42.360 --> 11:44.160
You might not know how important

11:44.270 --> 11:45.930
this book is to the Human Race.

11:46.470 --> 11:47.540
But in 10 years,

11:47.560 --> 11:48.440
or even 100 years,

11:48.440 --> 11:49.600
just you watch—

11:50.150 --> 11:52.210
the world will be completely changed

11:52.630 --> 11:53.840
by this book.

12:02.390 --> 12:03.240
Along the way,

12:04.170 --> 12:04.960
I interacted quite a lot

12:04.960 --> 12:06.290
with Wushuang Society.

12:06.630 --> 12:07.690
I thought I already

12:07.870 --> 12:09.530
knew plenty about you people.

12:10.270 --> 12:11.390
But it didn't occur to me

12:11.390 --> 12:12.480
until I met you, sir,

12:12.480 --> 12:14.540
that I probably doesn't know enough.

12:15.550 --> 12:16.480
What do you mean?

12:16.870 --> 12:17.960
I am very curious

12:18.910 --> 12:20.150
about who exactly

12:20.870 --> 12:21.670
is behind you.

12:24.360 --> 12:26.220
Above heaven, earth, sovereign,

12:26.360 --> 12:28.160
parents, and mentors, stands I.

12:28.720 --> 12:29.240
"I"?

12:29.600 --> 12:30.270
I mean

12:30.750 --> 12:31.810
every individual.

12:32.400 --> 12:33.480
You can take it

12:33.510 --> 12:34.670
as the common people

12:35.360 --> 12:36.720
and all living souls.

12:37.670 --> 12:38.470
That is to say,

12:39.030 --> 12:40.030
you're not backed

12:40.360 --> 12:41.160
by the dynasty

12:41.750 --> 12:42.630
or the Emperor?

12:43.200 --> 12:44.360
Of course not.

12:44.670 --> 12:46.530
The Emperor is over 100 years old.

12:46.840 --> 12:48.480
He is obsessed with immortality,

12:48.480 --> 12:49.740
maintaining his rule,

12:49.870 --> 12:51.800
and enjoying prosperity forever.

12:53.000 --> 12:55.030
Perhaps in this world,
no one is more eager

12:55.030 --> 12:56.000
for immortal sects to produce

12:56.000 --> 12:57.660
Immortality Pills than he is.

12:58.270 --> 12:59.530
Isn't it your wish too?

13:00.360 --> 13:01.790
It certainly is not.

13:02.750 --> 13:04.330
Time, by its nature,

13:04.360 --> 13:06.220
is the fairest thing in the world.

13:06.360 --> 13:07.550
He who attempts

13:07.550 --> 13:09.080
to break the barrier of time

13:09.550 --> 13:10.960
is our enemy.

13:17.670 --> 13:19.670
For every living soul in this world,

13:19.790 --> 13:21.990
there are only two paths to choose from.

13:22.030 --> 13:23.890
They either strive to go upwards,

13:24.000 --> 13:25.530
or maintain the status quo.

13:26.550 --> 13:27.910
The broken heavenly ladder

13:27.910 --> 13:30.080
is blocking cultivators' way to divinity.

13:30.080 --> 13:31.120
So, to defend the status

13:31.120 --> 13:32.080
they hold now,

13:32.320 --> 13:33.440
cultivators must not complacently

13:33.440 --> 13:34.900
stick to the old patterns.

13:35.240 --> 13:38.000
Instead, they need to befriend
nobles and high officials

13:38.000 --> 13:40.360
by offering secret magic
related to immortality.

13:40.360 --> 13:42.480
Given that, immortal sect,
prominent mortal families,

13:42.480 --> 13:44.080
and royal members are a whole

13:44.080 --> 13:45.280
with shared destiny.

13:45.440 --> 13:46.750
They depend on each other

13:46.750 --> 13:48.490
and are deeply intertwined.

13:49.320 --> 13:51.000
Everyone else but them

13:51.240 --> 13:52.240
is just

13:52.270 --> 13:53.870
an ordinary commoner.

13:55.390 --> 13:57.970
The privileged have the means to recruit
only their own kind,

13:57.970 --> 13:58.970
appoint cronies,

13:59.000 --> 14:00.320
weed out those who oppose them,

14:00.320 --> 14:02.250
and abuse power for personal gain.

14:02.320 --> 14:04.140
They hope for nothing
but keeping all benefits

14:04.140 --> 14:05.550
and advantages to themselves.

14:05.550 --> 14:06.510
That's just it.

14:07.940 --> 14:08.820
Your enemies

14:09.480 --> 14:10.810
sound rather powerful.

14:11.480 --> 14:12.320
Yes, they are.

14:12.880 --> 14:14.410
But we have no other option.

14:15.390 --> 14:16.200
We have to

14:17.480 --> 14:18.210
either fight

14:19.840 --> 14:20.440
or perish.

14:25.750 --> 14:26.870
That said, fortunately,

14:26.870 --> 14:28.870
some people of insight in this world

14:29.120 --> 14:31.580
will always step forward
in times of crisis.

14:31.840 --> 14:33.300
For example, Lu Zhanying.

14:33.550 --> 14:34.750
For another example,

14:35.440 --> 14:36.240
the two of you.

14:37.160 --> 14:38.960
We were born with no immortal perception.

14:38.960 --> 14:40.080
So we have no choice.

14:40.080 --> 14:42.910
You're endowed with immortal perception
and power,

14:42.910 --> 14:45.720
yet you still choose
to stand with us, the weak.

15:06.630 --> 15:08.110
What a fine zither.

15:08.630 --> 15:10.030
You have a good eye, hero.

15:10.430 --> 15:11.510
The strings and the body of the zither

15:11.510 --> 15:13.240
are made of exquisite materials.

15:13.240 --> 15:15.510
The music from it
is as crisp as cracking jade

15:15.510 --> 15:17.510
and tender as a dew-drenched lotus.

15:18.320 --> 15:20.390
The traveler longs for the road ahead.

15:20.390 --> 15:22.720
What can comfort a lonely heart like mine?

15:28.000 --> 15:33.600
♪ A joyous meeting is hard to find again ♪

15:34.480 --> 15:40.030
♪ Three years feel like
a thousand autumns ♪

15:40.870 --> 15:42.800
All I have is a brimming cup of wine,

15:42.870 --> 15:45.200
with which I hope to seal our bond
for life.

16:31.000 --> 16:31.800
My apologies.

16:33.000 --> 16:34.460
Li Si and Lyu Yunsu are also

16:34.790 --> 16:36.720
members of Wushuang Society then.

16:39.390 --> 16:40.200
So it was you

16:40.870 --> 16:41.720
who sent them to kill

16:41.720 --> 16:42.720
Divine Doctor Su?

16:44.240 --> 16:44.720
Yes.

16:45.940 --> 16:48.550
You sent that zither player
with medical skills

16:48.550 --> 16:50.150
to Chongling Valley as well?

16:50.620 --> 16:52.550
Su Taiyi already stopped treating

16:52.550 --> 16:54.210
ordinary people 10 years ago.

16:54.630 --> 16:56.080
It would be hard to kill him

16:56.080 --> 16:57.210
if he didn't show up.

16:57.550 --> 16:58.080
Therefore,

16:58.080 --> 16:59.880
we sent that zither player over.

16:59.990 --> 17:01.450
You are Su Taiyi's master.

17:01.670 --> 17:04.200
You should understand
what immortal sects don't.

17:04.200 --> 17:06.329
That is, in this world, not just knives

17:06.349 --> 17:07.480
can kill people.

17:08.030 --> 17:09.960
If Su Taiyi had managed to survive,

17:10.270 --> 17:11.270
what would you do?

17:11.310 --> 17:12.369
I was there to help.

17:13.310 --> 17:15.109
I carried Thunder Bombs with me.

17:15.319 --> 17:16.200
On the day the furnace was opened,

17:16.200 --> 17:17.930
those cultivators and Su Taiyi

17:18.160 --> 17:19.819
might survive the explosion,

17:20.109 --> 17:21.270
but at least, that batch

17:21.270 --> 17:23.270
of Immortal Pills would destroyed.

17:24.550 --> 17:26.349
After devising so many schemes,

17:26.460 --> 17:27.440
I assume you had learned something

17:27.440 --> 17:28.300
about Su Taiyi.

17:28.680 --> 17:30.440
He was already feeling remorse.

17:30.440 --> 17:31.200
It was also he who offered

17:31.200 --> 17:32.660
the Mind-Awakening Pills

17:32.680 --> 17:34.480
that Tai Shiqian and others ate.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.710
He did do us many favors.

17:36.830 --> 17:37.890
However, you still

17:38.590 --> 17:39.990
insisted on killing him.

17:41.270 --> 17:43.000
He held a different stance than ours.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.460
It left us no other choice.

17:50.200 --> 17:51.160
At this point,

17:52.240 --> 17:53.830
all I can say to you is sorry.

17:54.440 --> 17:56.500
Wushuang Society is indebted to you.

17:56.680 --> 17:58.340
If you want to avenge Su Taiyi,

17:58.880 --> 17:59.740
then come at me.

18:00.240 --> 18:02.100
Whether you kill me or torture me,

18:03.920 --> 18:05.380
I will have no complaints.

18:17.520 --> 18:21.640
[Zhi's Residence]

18:56.000 --> 18:57.530
Aren't you going to kill me?

18:57.790 --> 18:58.880
Su Taiyi was smart.

19:00.010 --> 19:01.510
The zither player was undercover
beside him for years.

19:01.510 --> 19:02.710
How would he not know?

19:03.160 --> 19:04.760
He gave you his recognition.

19:05.070 --> 19:05.870
But you people

19:06.510 --> 19:07.640
never believed him.

19:08.310 --> 19:10.440
Those Immortality Pills mattered a lot.

19:10.440 --> 19:12.440
I could not stake humanity's future

19:12.590 --> 19:14.240
on his genuine heart.

19:18.510 --> 19:19.040
Let's go.

19:24.310 --> 19:25.570
If you people succeed,

19:25.960 --> 19:26.960
can you guarantee

19:26.960 --> 19:28.550
that you'll do better than immortal sect?

19:28.550 --> 19:29.550
Will the Emperor,

19:29.960 --> 19:30.750
officials,

19:31.200 --> 19:32.350
you, and your fellows

19:32.350 --> 19:33.480
all be fair and just?

19:34.270 --> 19:35.000
Are you sure

19:35.240 --> 19:36.960
there will be no such thing
as the Immortality Tax

19:36.960 --> 19:38.160
in the world anymore?

19:40.240 --> 19:41.240
Perhaps.

19:42.440 --> 19:44.040
But that's about the future.

19:44.550 --> 19:45.550
Our current priority

19:45.550 --> 19:47.110
is to enter the game.

19:56.000 --> 19:56.510
Sheng.

20:18.200 --> 20:18.680
Senior Sister.

20:18.530 --> 20:19.960
♪ The vault of heaven is shaking,
on the verge of collapse ♪

20:19.790 --> 20:20.680
Are we going to fight our way out?

20:20.210 --> 20:23.070
♪ Yet I refuse to yield or make amends ♪

20:25.210 --> 20:26.640
♪ Rather than linger in fleeting winds
and moonlight ♪

20:27.070 --> 20:30.890
♪ I would choose to stand
between all beings and fate itself ♪

20:31.460 --> 20:34.500
♪ Walking the edge of a blade,
I cast aside life and death ♪

20:35.070 --> 20:38.590
♪ Vowing to speak out against injustice ♪

20:39.080 --> 20:41.910
♪ If my cultivation turns
to ash and smoke ♪

20:42.080 --> 20:43.950
♪ I still want to see this world ♪

20:44.010 --> 20:46.500
♪ Brightened by the people ♪

20:46.600 --> 20:50.250
♪ Not afraid of having my eyes
clouded by mist ♪

20:50.810 --> 20:53.480
♪ I'm determined to fight for peace ♪

20:53.500 --> 20:57.170
♪ Do you hear the raging tides of fury ♪

20:57.190 --> 20:59.810
♪ How many sorrows
have finally been laid to rest ♪

20:59.830 --> 21:02.740
♪ How many stand without bias or tilt ♪

21:02.760 --> 21:05.930
♪ Pointing to the sky,
questioning the moon ♪

21:06.500 --> 21:09.670
♪ I'd rather be a wandering immortal
in the mortal world ♪

21:09.690 --> 21:12.930
♪ And experience it all for myself ♪

21:13.460 --> 21:16.540
♪ Right and wrong, justice and evil ♪

21:16.570 --> 21:20.090
♪ In all the world,
I choose first the people ♪

21:20.500 --> 21:23.340
♪ How could the powerful lie drunk
in golden halls ♪

21:23.460 --> 21:26.810
♪ Illusions of heaven
and memory entwined ♪

21:27.130 --> 21:29.040
♪ I will still break
into this mortal realm ♪

21:29.070 --> 21:32.320
♪ To demand a rightful ending ♪

21:32.940 --> 21:35.570
♪ I lash the darkness
with a furious strike ♪

21:36.500 --> 21:39.340
♪ Fall into the abyss,
then awaken once more ♪

21:39.990 --> 21:43.100
♪ If you refuse injustice,
then open your eyes ♪

21:43.120 --> 21:48.160
♪ To save this world of mortal
fire and smoke ♪

22:06.750 --> 22:07.550
What's wrong?

22:07.680 --> 22:08.940
Something in your eye?

22:10.000 --> 22:10.480
No.

22:11.030 --> 22:12.350
Maybe I'm just tired from the journey.

22:12.350 --> 22:14.680
I've been feeling a bit unwell these days.

22:15.880 --> 22:17.880
I don't see anything wrong with your eye.

22:17.880 --> 22:19.350
When we get back to Xin Xie Manor,

22:19.350 --> 22:21.080
let's ask Master to check on it.

22:25.550 --> 22:26.880
Why didn't Lord of Rust-Sword

22:26.880 --> 22:27.940
come back with you?

22:28.880 --> 22:29.510
We were being chased

22:29.510 --> 22:30.510
by Tianyuan Sect.

22:31.130 --> 22:31.880
He drove the carriage

22:31.880 --> 22:33.590
away to distract the pursuers.

22:33.590 --> 22:35.120
I don't know where he is now.

22:35.790 --> 22:36.790
But we made a pact.

22:37.200 --> 22:38.220
If we survived,

22:38.480 --> 22:40.410
we would meet at the Safe Haven Inn.

22:40.720 --> 22:41.120
Got it.

22:41.400 --> 22:42.070
Then let's wait for him

22:42.070 --> 22:43.270
at the Safe Haven Inn.

23:04.030 --> 23:05.090
What is this sound?

23:06.880 --> 23:09.210
The death knell from the Imperial Palace.

23:09.510 --> 23:10.510
Emperor Zong Ding

23:11.620 --> 23:12.550
has passed away.

23:27.510 --> 23:29.870
[Central Palace Gate]

24:12.550 --> 24:13.640
But now,

24:15.270 --> 24:17.310
as I truly sit upon this throne,

24:20.410 --> 24:21.800
all I can see

24:21.830 --> 24:24.200
are these square courtyards,

24:25.920 --> 24:28.070
and the ministers coming and going.

24:29.680 --> 24:31.640
I long to go out to see the world.

24:32.110 --> 24:34.510
But I am afraid of losing this throne.

24:35.900 --> 24:37.050
This throne—

24:39.440 --> 24:40.640
you carried me

24:41.510 --> 24:43.070
on your back,

24:44.270 --> 24:46.070
trudging through wind and snow,

24:46.430 --> 24:47.990
through dark alleys,

24:48.790 --> 24:51.440
through countless schemes,

24:51.750 --> 24:54.510
blood, and filth to seize it for me.

24:55.510 --> 24:56.590
If I lose it,

24:57.960 --> 24:59.960
there will never be anyone else

25:02.510 --> 25:03.680
to carry me

25:04.990 --> 25:06.680
and win it back again.

25:12.470 --> 25:13.070
Let's go.

25:31.130 --> 25:42.350
[In Perfect Safety]

25:34.200 --> 25:36.000
In the blink of an eye,

25:36.240 --> 25:37.400
I drew out the Rust Sword,

25:37.400 --> 25:38.730
swung it left and right,

25:39.070 --> 25:41.300
and almost struck Sima Randeng down

25:41.400 --> 25:42.660
right under his mount.

25:43.030 --> 25:45.310
Thousands of cultivators were there,

25:45.750 --> 25:48.010
yet they were too scared to step forward.

25:49.000 --> 25:50.720
You even managed to injure
a Nascent Soul cultivator?

25:50.720 --> 25:51.720
Don't interrupt.

25:52.440 --> 25:53.100
Where was I?

25:54.590 --> 25:56.750
They hounded me into a mountain.

25:57.350 --> 25:58.950
I had no choice but to abandon

25:59.200 --> 26:00.460
the carriage and hide.

26:01.030 --> 26:01.880
Then, they used

26:01.880 --> 26:04.000
tracking spells

26:05.000 --> 26:07.640
to search for me inch by inch.

26:08.640 --> 26:09.640
Did they find you?

26:09.640 --> 26:10.920
Of course not!

26:12.750 --> 26:14.270
I stayed hidden.

26:14.680 --> 26:15.740
Where did you hide?

26:17.480 --> 26:19.200
Right behind them.

26:19.630 --> 26:21.750
I hung upside down on a vine

26:22.200 --> 26:22.950
and then

26:23.290 --> 26:25.090
sneaked to their rear.

26:25.110 --> 26:26.550
Swish! Just like that,

26:27.030 --> 26:29.590
I slayed 10 men with blood-stained hands.

26:29.790 --> 26:31.050
Swoosh! And like that,

26:31.920 --> 26:34.590
I slayed another 10 men
with fierce appearances.

26:34.590 --> 26:35.050
At last,

26:35.270 --> 26:36.270
swish!

26:36.790 --> 26:37.350
I pierced

26:37.680 --> 26:39.740
right through the center
of the crowd

26:40.070 --> 26:43.670
with my sword,
where the first-grade disciple
of Tianyuan Sect,

26:43.920 --> 26:46.110
Sima Randeng, was.

26:48.920 --> 26:50.590
Impressive.

26:51.030 --> 26:52.690
I'd rather keep a low profile.

26:59.310 --> 27:00.000
Sorry.

27:00.550 --> 27:01.950
Go on with your bragging.

27:03.030 --> 27:03.830
Keep talking.

27:04.350 --> 27:05.610
You should believe it.

27:05.750 --> 27:07.070
I used a set of sword skills

27:07.070 --> 27:08.600
and made them flee in panic.

27:09.110 --> 27:10.910
That was supreme swordsmanship

27:10.920 --> 27:12.550
and my own creation—

27:13.880 --> 27:15.830
Shijue Rust Swordsmanship.

27:16.640 --> 27:18.240
Why did you name it "Shijue"?

27:19.310 --> 27:21.110
Lu Qianqiao uses Jiujue Sword.

27:21.350 --> 27:23.210
Since I'm a bit stronger than him,

27:23.720 --> 27:26.270
my swordsmanship
should sound better than his.

27:26.270 --> 27:26.880
Amazing.

27:32.310 --> 27:33.110
They are back.

27:41.310 --> 27:42.070
You are back.

27:42.970 --> 27:43.590
I have to say,

27:43.590 --> 27:44.960
you walked so slowly.

27:45.510 --> 27:46.000
We must have

27:46.000 --> 27:47.520
a proper celebration tonight.

27:47.520 --> 27:48.200
As the saying goes,

27:48.200 --> 27:50.070
he who escapes death
will have good fortune.

27:50.070 --> 27:52.830
It should be, "he who survives a disaster
will have good fortune."

27:52.830 --> 27:53.790
Close enough.

27:54.350 --> 27:55.280
You have no idea.

27:55.680 --> 27:56.540
I was literally

27:56.730 --> 27:57.920
crawled out from a bloodbath

27:57.920 --> 27:58.680
and a hell of blades.

27:58.680 --> 27:59.350
At that time,

27:59.350 --> 28:00.590
thousands of cultivators

28:00.590 --> 28:02.070
put me under siege.

28:02.090 --> 28:02.420
I...

28:03.960 --> 28:05.350
Why aren't you listening?

28:05.350 --> 28:06.680
To what, your bragging?

28:07.510 --> 28:08.570
How is it bragging?

28:09.110 --> 28:10.640
Thousands of cultivators?

28:10.750 --> 28:11.960
I'm a cultivator myself.

28:11.960 --> 28:14.020
Fight me if you have a problem with me.

28:15.510 --> 28:15.960
Fine.

28:16.880 --> 28:18.740
Finger-guessing game or Pai Gow?

28:38.480 --> 28:38.960
Ding,

28:40.110 --> 28:41.240
you already won.

28:43.640 --> 28:44.550
Relax.

28:46.070 --> 28:47.470
Get a good night's sleep.

29:00.160 --> 29:01.270
You haven't said a word

29:01.270 --> 29:02.600
since I saw you just now.

29:03.480 --> 29:04.410
Are you alright?

29:06.640 --> 29:07.570
I don't know why,

29:08.070 --> 29:09.730
but I keep thinking about Ding

29:11.070 --> 29:12.510
and the days we supported each other

29:12.510 --> 29:13.840
in the Imperial Palace.

29:15.310 --> 29:17.170
No matter how he treated me later,

29:17.790 --> 29:19.190
our friendship back then

29:19.200 --> 29:19.920
was real.

29:22.200 --> 29:23.600
I've also been wondering

29:24.200 --> 29:25.270
if a long life

29:25.880 --> 29:27.480
really is a gift from heaven.

29:29.270 --> 29:30.800
What do you think it is then?

29:31.590 --> 29:33.190
It's more like a punishment,

29:33.720 --> 29:35.580
for the one who makes it to the end.

29:35.720 --> 29:37.480
This person has to watch their friends

29:37.480 --> 29:38.920
and family depart one by one,

29:38.920 --> 29:41.120
and finally be left alone in this world.

29:42.480 --> 29:43.880
Suddenly glancing back,

29:44.030 --> 29:46.640
this person finds his life
has nowhere to trace back to,

29:46.640 --> 29:47.640
and nowhere to go.

29:57.440 --> 29:58.370
That was before.

29:58.860 --> 30:00.320
Things are different now.

30:00.960 --> 30:01.890
You have friends

30:02.680 --> 30:03.510
and family.

30:05.640 --> 30:07.240
When you finish the last step

30:07.890 --> 30:08.590
and transform your heart,

30:08.590 --> 30:10.190
you'll be an ordinary human.

30:16.070 --> 30:18.270
Are you going back to Chongling Valley?

30:19.750 --> 30:21.150
I got a letter from Zhu Yu,

30:21.200 --> 30:23.350
saying that all the preparation is done.

30:23.350 --> 30:24.550
I'll go with you then.

30:24.890 --> 30:25.830
Lord of Rust-Sword will go with me.

30:25.830 --> 30:26.690
That's enough.

30:26.720 --> 30:27.550
No way.

30:28.000 --> 30:29.600
Heart transformation is utterly dangerous.

30:29.600 --> 30:30.550
I must stay by your side

30:30.550 --> 30:32.010
for such a serious matter.

30:33.440 --> 30:34.960
Chongling Valley is safe.

30:35.830 --> 30:38.230
Previously, you saw
how I renewed my flesh,

30:38.310 --> 30:39.310
bones, and blood.

30:39.790 --> 30:40.850
Nothing happened.

30:41.320 --> 30:41.930
Besides,

30:41.960 --> 30:43.160
I might be distracted

30:43.400 --> 30:44.510
by your presence.

30:45.110 --> 30:45.550
But...

30:45.570 --> 30:46.550
Don't worry.

30:47.110 --> 30:48.310
I will return safely.

31:22.960 --> 31:25.270
Senior, you seem to be
full of strength today,

31:25.270 --> 31:26.870
for filling the vats so soon.

31:26.920 --> 31:28.160
-Right.
-Yes.

31:29.110 --> 31:30.200
Now, Senior Brother Bai

31:30.200 --> 31:31.160
is no different from a mortal.

31:31.160 --> 31:31.690
Exactly.

31:31.920 --> 31:33.160
No need to fear him, right?

31:33.160 --> 31:33.750
Right.

31:34.330 --> 31:34.980
I agree.

32:00.590 --> 32:01.650
What are you doing?

32:03.070 --> 32:03.790
Is it him?

32:56.440 --> 32:57.570
Senior Brother Bai?

32:58.920 --> 32:59.850
Why are you here?

33:08.310 --> 33:09.510
Senior, taste it now.

33:10.240 --> 33:11.170
It's still warm.

33:15.030 --> 33:16.410
How did you get this drumstick?

33:16.410 --> 33:17.200
I helped that old master

33:17.200 --> 33:18.440
at the mountaintop wipe the bell there.

33:18.440 --> 33:19.570
So he gave this to me.

33:19.920 --> 33:20.550
What bell?

33:20.730 --> 33:22.280
The Infinity Bell

33:22.310 --> 33:23.400
on Qingtian Peak.

33:24.960 --> 33:25.880
That bell is the key

33:25.880 --> 33:27.750
to activating
the Mountain-Guarding Formation.

33:27.750 --> 33:29.310
Non-core disciples cannot approach it.

33:29.310 --> 33:30.880
Why would they send you on the task?

33:30.880 --> 33:32.140
That huge bell is mute.

33:32.590 --> 33:34.700
Only Nascent Soul cultivators can ring it.

33:34.700 --> 33:35.960
I'm just a Qi Refining cultivator.

33:35.960 --> 33:37.490
Who would guard against me?

33:39.720 --> 33:40.720
By the way, Senior Brother Bai,

33:40.720 --> 33:42.650
what were you looking for just now?

33:43.440 --> 33:44.590
I bumped into someone

33:44.590 --> 33:45.790
who looked familiar.

33:45.880 --> 33:47.140
I think I was mistaken.

33:48.240 --> 33:49.130
Just now,

33:49.240 --> 33:50.880
only Elder Mo Guan passed by.

33:52.200 --> 33:52.790
Mo Guan?

33:53.790 --> 33:54.920
Which elder is that?

33:55.270 --> 33:57.000
I've never seen him in the sect.

33:57.200 --> 33:58.060
That's normal.

33:58.160 --> 33:59.790
Elder Mo Guan either stays in seclusion

33:59.790 --> 34:01.070
or leaves the mountain for procurement.

34:01.070 --> 34:02.560
Let alone you, Senior Brother Bai,

34:02.560 --> 34:03.310
even I, can't often

34:03.310 --> 34:04.440
see him though I stay

34:04.480 --> 34:05.810
in the sect all day long.

34:08.150 --> 34:09.280
If you see him again,

34:09.590 --> 34:10.440
be mindful and gather

34:10.440 --> 34:11.570
information for me.

34:11.900 --> 34:12.560
No problem.

34:12.630 --> 34:13.630
Consider it done.

34:14.030 --> 34:14.489
Thanks.

34:16.000 --> 34:16.460
Come on.

34:25.550 --> 34:26.679
Senior Brother Bai,

34:26.880 --> 34:28.340
it seems you have changed.

34:28.960 --> 34:30.020
How have I changed?

34:31.150 --> 34:33.150
You're just different from before.

34:33.690 --> 34:35.290
I can't name any specifics,

34:36.150 --> 34:38.840
but you're more like a human
now than before.

34:41.840 --> 34:42.320
I...

34:42.800 --> 34:44.659
I don't mean anything offensive.

34:45.400 --> 34:46.190
You're right.

34:46.190 --> 34:47.389
I am a human by nature.

34:53.260 --> 34:54.840
[Fulai Inn]

34:55.110 --> 34:55.670
I'm back!

34:56.860 --> 34:57.760
You're finally back.

34:57.760 --> 34:58.510
I'm starving.

34:58.510 --> 34:59.570
What are we eating?

35:00.230 --> 35:01.360
Bean soup and buns.

35:01.590 --> 35:02.400
Buns again?

35:02.880 --> 35:03.960
What's wrong with buns?

35:03.960 --> 35:05.800
They contain vegetables and meat
and fill the stomach.

35:05.800 --> 35:07.830
But we can't just have buns every day.

35:07.830 --> 35:09.150
He doesn't do much all day,

35:09.150 --> 35:10.210
yet he whines a lot.

35:10.710 --> 35:12.170
Next time, you go buy food.

35:12.400 --> 35:13.330
Fine. I'll do it.

35:16.070 --> 35:16.590
Look,

35:16.710 --> 35:17.440
we've been watching

35:17.440 --> 35:18.480
this place for over a month.

35:18.480 --> 35:20.110
There isn't a sound from inside.

35:20.110 --> 35:21.510
When will these days end?

35:21.760 --> 35:23.070
Whether a cultivator
can reach a new stage

35:23.070 --> 35:24.280
depends most on chance.

35:24.280 --> 35:25.480
When one gets an opportunity,

35:25.480 --> 35:26.670
it's common for him to stay

35:26.670 --> 35:27.880
in seclusion for 3 to 5 years.

35:27.880 --> 35:29.030
Anyway, it's a good thing.

35:29.030 --> 35:30.590
Let's just wait and observe.

35:30.590 --> 35:31.000
Dig in.

36:09.360 --> 36:11.220
The ultimate Dao ties to nothing.

36:11.320 --> 36:13.320
A void appears in Lingtai acupoint.

36:13.800 --> 36:14.800
I have reached...

36:16.280 --> 36:17.140
the Void Stage.

36:21.320 --> 36:23.400
I've formed a Golden Core.

36:27.000 --> 36:28.000
This feels great.

36:28.960 --> 36:29.760
How about you?

36:30.440 --> 36:31.880
Thanks to your help, Mr. Lin,

36:31.880 --> 36:33.630
I've advanced to the Void Stage.

36:33.630 --> 36:34.230
Thank you.

36:38.190 --> 36:39.390
You're very welcome.

36:39.630 --> 36:40.590
It was no trouble.

36:40.590 --> 36:41.150
Besides,

36:41.510 --> 36:42.360
on this matter,

36:42.360 --> 36:44.090
I actually benefited from you.

36:45.220 --> 36:46.880
I'd like to ask you something.

36:46.960 --> 36:47.690
What exactly

36:48.400 --> 36:49.600
happened to your arm?

36:51.110 --> 36:52.110
Just an accident.

36:52.630 --> 36:54.760
Luckily, out of misfortune came good.

36:55.550 --> 36:56.680
It's all in the past.

36:59.190 --> 36:59.650
Let's go

37:00.340 --> 37:01.470
have a celebration.

37:01.670 --> 37:02.600
I'll arrange it.

37:02.800 --> 37:03.660
I'm afraid not.

37:03.880 --> 37:05.030
I just made an achievement.

37:05.030 --> 37:07.430
I'd like to officially enter the mountain.

37:07.590 --> 37:08.110
Sure.

37:08.800 --> 37:10.200
I've been out for so long.

37:10.230 --> 37:11.320
It's high time I went home

37:11.320 --> 37:12.380
to visit my father.

37:13.440 --> 37:13.840
Look,

37:14.360 --> 37:15.440
let's have drinks next time

37:15.440 --> 37:16.480
I'm in Tianyin Mountain.

37:16.480 --> 37:17.280
It'll be your treat.

37:17.280 --> 37:18.010
Absolutely.

37:18.920 --> 37:19.450
Goodbye.

37:25.150 --> 37:26.320
I've formed a Golden Core.

37:26.320 --> 37:27.850
It calls for a celebration.

37:30.280 --> 37:32.080
Had better prepare a few feasts.

37:45.110 --> 37:45.920
Elder Mo Guan?

37:46.360 --> 37:47.160
Elder Mo Guan!

38:08.280 --> 38:08.880
Elder.

38:10.400 --> 38:10.960
Elder?

38:12.800 --> 38:13.440
Elder!

38:18.670 --> 38:20.070
A Qinghong Sect uniform?

38:37.070 --> 38:37.590
Senior,

38:38.070 --> 38:39.000
anything wrong?

38:40.150 --> 38:41.710
Yuanqi didn't come back last night.

38:41.710 --> 38:42.280
Juniors,

38:42.280 --> 38:43.540
do you know where he is?

38:44.360 --> 38:44.880
No.

38:45.320 --> 38:46.560
I haven't seen him either.

38:46.560 --> 38:47.920
But over the past few days, he did mention

38:47.920 --> 38:48.880
he'd like to visit home.

38:48.880 --> 38:50.510
Maybe he has left the mountain by now.

38:50.510 --> 38:52.360
Why don't you go ask about him
at Xiejian Pool?

38:52.360 --> 38:54.440
The disciples there keep a log
of access and exit.

38:54.440 --> 38:54.900
Thanks.

38:55.070 --> 38:56.200
Senior Brother Bai!

38:56.230 --> 38:57.030
Bad news!

38:58.280 --> 38:59.410
Senior Brother Bai!

39:00.000 --> 39:01.130
Senior Brother Bai!

39:01.150 --> 39:02.810
Bad news, Senior Brother Bai!

39:02.920 --> 39:04.050
Senior Brother Bai!

39:04.230 --> 39:04.710
Yuanqi!

39:05.710 --> 39:06.840
Yuanqi! Yuanqi!

39:09.230 --> 39:10.090
What happened?

39:10.150 --> 39:11.800
We found him in the back mountain.

39:11.800 --> 39:12.590
We have no idea

39:12.590 --> 39:13.790
who hurt him so badly.

39:13.800 --> 39:14.460
Senior Bai,

39:14.590 --> 39:15.280
what should we do?

39:15.280 --> 39:16.230
Mo... Mo...

39:16.400 --> 39:16.860
Yuanqi.

39:16.920 --> 39:17.400
Mo...

39:17.630 --> 39:18.000
What?

39:18.760 --> 39:19.560
-What?
-Mo...

39:20.000 --> 39:20.360
Mo...

39:20.510 --> 39:20.970
Yuanqi.

39:21.670 --> 39:22.150
Yuanqi!

39:22.510 --> 39:23.070
Yuanqi!

39:35.510 --> 39:36.170
Senior Bai.

39:36.280 --> 39:37.410
I need to see Master.

39:37.480 --> 39:38.780
Yuanqi's heart meridians are ruptured.

39:38.780 --> 39:39.760
Only the sect leader's primordial energy

39:39.760 --> 39:40.510
can save him.

39:40.670 --> 39:42.070
The sect leader
is having a meeting in the hall.

39:42.070 --> 39:43.110
Nobody is allowed in

39:43.110 --> 39:44.190
without permission.

39:44.190 --> 39:44.880
But this is urgent.

39:44.880 --> 39:46.010
Senior Brother Bai!

39:46.590 --> 39:48.000
I am only acting on orders.

39:48.000 --> 39:49.800
Please don't give me a hard time.

39:59.320 --> 40:01.070
This humble disciple, Bai Zongying,

40:01.070 --> 40:03.270
requests an audience with Sect Master!

40:14.880 --> 40:16.080
Sect Master, I beg you

40:16.760 --> 40:18.030
to save Yuanqi's life!

40:22.960 --> 40:24.550
This humble disciple, Bai Zongying,

40:24.550 --> 40:26.750
requests an audience with Sect Master!

40:40.550 --> 40:41.750
Sect Master, I beg you

40:42.320 --> 40:43.800
to save Yuanqi's life!

41:06.970 --> 41:11.250
[Guiyuan Hall]

41:09.590 --> 41:11.320
The sect master is discussing matters

41:11.320 --> 41:13.050
in the hall with all the elders.

41:14.510 --> 41:16.070
Senior, you're making a scene here.

41:16.070 --> 41:16.920
What is it for?

41:18.150 --> 41:20.480
Only the sect leader's primordial energy

41:20.630 --> 41:22.760
can revive Yuanqi's heart meridians.

41:24.400 --> 41:25.200
Bai Zongying,

41:25.630 --> 41:26.880
did you lose your immortal perception

41:26.880 --> 41:28.000
or your brain?

41:28.480 --> 41:30.070
He's just an outer-circle disciple.

41:30.070 --> 41:31.560
How is he worthy of being saved

41:31.560 --> 41:32.590
by the sect master's

41:32.590 --> 41:34.250
precious primordial energy?

41:34.590 --> 41:36.800
That'll damage the master's cultivation.

41:36.800 --> 41:38.530
If you still have your dignity,

41:39.880 --> 41:41.110
leave immediately.

41:42.510 --> 41:43.440
Junior Randeng.

41:43.760 --> 41:44.690
Junior Randeng!

41:56.280 --> 41:58.710
This humble disciple, Bai Zongying,

41:59.880 --> 42:01.280
implores the sect master

42:02.400 --> 42:03.920
to save Yuanqi's life!
